  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"G\xFC\xE7\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin {{isim}}.\n\nS\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131larda
    sabretmi\u015F ve zorluklar\u0131n \xFCstesinden ba\u015Far\u0131yla gelmi\u015Fsin.
    Bu karta g\xF6re \xF6yle tecr\xFCbeler edinmi\u015Fsin ki, pek \xE7ok \u015Feye
    dair hayati birtak\u0131m korkular\u0131n\u0131 yenmi\u015Fsin. \"G\xFC\xE7 ve
    cesaret\" art\u0131k senin. Kritik ve seni kal\u0131c\u0131 mutsuzlu\u011Fa s\xFCr\xFCkleyebilecek
    d\xF6nemleri atlatm\u0131\u015F, yontularak da olsa harika \u015Fekillenmi\u015Fsin.
    Hayat seni, risk almaktan korkmayan, kendine g\xFCveni y\xFCksek ve cesur birine
    d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrm\xFC\u015F. Seni zora sokmak isteyen ki\u015Fileri saf
    d\u0131\u015F\u0131 b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015F ve mutlu bir gelecek i\xE7in \xF6n\xFCn\xFC
    a\xE7m\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. "
